            "type": "markdown",
            "id": "396d9f5d598cf19e",
            "text": "Open a page, then choose **Voice Tool** from the \u2630 menu: the tool opens to the right and speaks to that page. The recording and its transcript are stored in the page's assets straight away; the summary is written only when you press **Add to page** \u2014 three items, placed before the page's See section: the recording, the summary, and a link to the full transcript."
