            "type": "markdown",
            "id": "166c22321dcc3ce4",
            "text": "Prompts come from a prompt wiki (**PROMPTS:**, default prompt.geek.fish), read after this site. Fork a prompt page to this site and your copy is the one used \u2014 see [[Prompt Format]]. Transcription runs on the farm serving this page (faster-whisper); summaries come from Claude, or from an Ollama model where the farm is set up for one."
          },
